effort change. These are before/after observations, not a reconstructed transition history.
Request handling: the logs show rate limiting, timeouts, proxy retries and invalid folders/nan requests.
All three displayed task-fetch stages report zero missing requested IDs, including the stage after the final
displayed retry. This supports task-batch recovery, not proof that every discovery request succeeded.
